Azure AI Text Analysis

Overview

This project demonstrates my understanding of Azure AI and natural language processing concepts learned while completing the Microsoft Azure AI Fundamentals certification.

What This Project Demonstrates

* Natural language processing (NLP)
* Text analysis
* Sentiment analysis
* Key phrase extraction
* Named entity recognition
* Azure AI services concepts
* Working with AI APIs
* Understanding AI input and output

Example Scenario

A business receives customer feedback and wants to automatically analyze the responses.

Example input:

“The customer service was excellent, but the delivery took too long.”

An AI language service can analyze the text and identify:

* Sentiment: Mixed/Negative
* Key phrases: customer service, delivery
* Important entities: customer service, delivery

